{
  "title": "33 Elementary - Foul!",
  "audio": "./assets/englishpod_B0033pb.mp3",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.",
      "trans": "您好，英语学习者，欢迎再次来到英语pod。我的名字是马科。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我是艾瑞克。",
      "start": 4.92,
      "end": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "And today we have another great elementary lesson for you all.",
      "trans": "今天我们为大家分享一个有趣的初级课程。",
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 9.36
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right. We've got a lesson for all you sports fans out there.",
      "trans": "英语：那对，我们有课程供你所有体育爱好者们学习。",
      "start": 9.36,
      "end": 12.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. We're doing a podcast on sports today.",
      "trans": "正确：英语：今天我们将播体育新闻。",
      "start": 12.64,
      "end": 15.4
    },
    {
      "text": "We're starting off with basketball.",
      "trans": "我们是从篮球开始的。",
      "start": 15.4,
      "end": 17.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh-huh. So we've got lots of language about basketball and sports in this lesson today.",
