      "start": 17.56,
      "end": 23.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So let's take a look at our vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请看我们的词汇预览：",
      "start": 23.68,
      "end": 26.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 26.68,
      "end": 28.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Two words for you today. The first one is foul.",
      "trans": "今天你有什么问题？第一个问题是“傻瓜”。",
      "start": 29.2,
      "end": 33.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Fowl.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"fowl\" 通常指的是鸡。如果你需要翻译成其他语言，请告诉我具体是哪个语言？",
      "start": 33.04,
      "end": 33.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Fowl.",
      "trans": "鸡",
      "start": 33.84,
      "end": 34.84
    },
    {
      "text": "A foul.",
      "trans": "一个恶。",
      "start": 34.84,
      "end": 36.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Basically, it's an action in a game that is not allowed.",
      "trans": "基本来说，这是一款在游戏中的动作。",
      "start": 36.44,
      "end": 40.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. So if you're playing basketball and you kick the other player,",
      "trans": "是的，所以如果你在打篮球时不小心把对方撞倒了，你应该卸下你的责任。",
      "start": 40.2,
      "end": 43.64
    },
    {
      "text": "that's a foul.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：",
      "start": 43.64,
      "end": 44.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a foul. That's a pretty big foul.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：",
      "start": 44.44,
      "end": 45.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah. If you're playing soccer and you pick up the ball.",
      "trans": "是的。如果你在踢足球并捡起球，那么你就是点和拍相机了。",
      "start": 45.8,
      "end": 49.239999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "That's also a foul.",
      "trans": "这也是不雅的。",
      "start": 49.239999999999995,
      "end": 50.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh?",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接翻译中文到另一种语言。不过，我可以尝试用英文来回答你的问题。",
      "start": 50.28,
      "end": 50.879999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Our second word is ref.",
      "trans": "我们的第二个词是“ref”。",
      "start": 50.879999999999995,
      "end": 53.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Ref. R-E-F.",
      "trans": "参考：R-E-F.",
      "start": 53.44,
      "end": 55.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Also known as a referee.",
      "trans": "英语：也称为裁判。",
      "start": 55.04,
      "end": 56.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Mm-hmm.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯。",
      "start": 56.72,
      "end": 57.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Right?",
      "trans": "是的。",
      "start": 57.24,
      "end": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So a referee is...",
      "trans": "所以一个裁判员是...",
      "start": 58.12,
      "end": 59.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Basically like the judge of a game.",
      "trans": "基本上，它像一名游戏的法官。",
      "start": 59.8,
      "end": 61.92
    },
    {
      "text": "The judge of the game.",
      "trans": "游戏的评判员。",
      "start": 61.92,
      "end": 62.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So he's the one that will say that was a foul.",
      "trans": "所以他就是那个说那是一场恶战的人。",
      "start": 62.92,
      "end": 65.76
    },
    {
      "text": "That was a foul, exactly.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：",
      "start": 65.76,
      "end": 67.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是啊。",
      "start": 67.2,
      "end": 68.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Also known as referee.",
      "trans": "英语：也称为裁判。",
      "start": 68.2,
      "end": 69.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so two great words.",
      "trans": "好的，那么请将需要翻译的英文句子提供给我。",
      "start": 69.68,
      "end": 71.52
    },
    {
      "text": "We're going to hear them in our dialogue.",
      "trans": "我们将在对话中听到他们。",
      "start": 71.52,
      "end": 73.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And we're going to be listening to two guys who are watching a basketball game on TV.",
