      "start": 73.68,
      "end": 79.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, is the game started yet?",
      "trans": "你好，游戏已经开始了吗？",
      "start": 79.2,
      "end": 86.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, about five minutes ago.",
      "trans": "是的，刚才五分钟左右。",
      "start": 86.2,
      "end": 88.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Who's winning?",
      "trans": "谁赢了？",
      "start": 88.2,
      "end": 89.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Balls of course.",
      "trans": "当然的球。",
      "start": 89.2,
      "end": 90.2
    },
    {
      "text": "What?",
      "trans": "什么?",
      "start": 90.2,
      "end": 91.2
