    {
      "text": "Oh, come on, ref.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，来吧，重。",
      "start": 92.2,
      "end": 93.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, worry.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，担心。",
      "start": 93.2,
      "end": 94.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.",
      "trans": "沙克总是失误投篮。",
      "start": 94.2,
      "end": 97.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You're right.",
      "trans": "你做得对。",
      "start": 97.2,
      "end": 98.2
    },
    {
      "text": "He didn't make the shot.",
      "trans": "他没有按下快门。",
      "start": 98.2,
      "end": 102.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that was a great shot.",
      "trans": "嗯，那个照片真是好。",
