      "text": "Can't believe you didn't see that.",
      "trans": "真没想到你没看到那个。",
      "start": 117.2,
      "end": 119.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 119.2,
      "end": 120.2
    },
    {
      "text": "I ended the first quarter.",
      "trans": "我结束了第一季度。",
      "start": 120.2,
      "end": 121.2
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, I'm going to make a beer run.",
      "trans": "英语：一切好，我将参加啤酒跑。",
      "start": 121.2,
      "end": 125.2
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, a really common situation whenever you're watching games with friends, right?",
