      "start": 134.2,
      "end": 136.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at language takeaway.",
      "trans": "让我们看看语言的取向。",
      "start": 136.2,
      "end": 143.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Language takeaway.",
      "trans": "语言总结。",
      "start": 143.2,
      "end": 144.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let's take a look at our first word on language takeaway.",
      "trans": "好的，让我们一起看看我们的第一个语言小贴士。",
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 149.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Free throw.",
      "trans": "英语：三分球。",
      "start": 149.2,
      "end": 151.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Free throw.",
      "trans": "英语：三分球。",
      "start": 151.2,
      "end": 153.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Free throw.",
      "trans": "英语：跳投。",
      "start": 153.2,
      "end": 154.2
