      "start": 241.20000000000002,
      "end": 242.20000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "So anytime you shoot the ball, you can make the shot.",
      "trans": "所以，无论何时你投篮，都可以做出精彩的进球。",
      "start": 242.20000000000002,
