      "start": 287.64,
      "end": 288.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you take more than two steps in that's traveling.",
      "trans": "所以当你在那多走几步，那就是旅行了。",
      "start": 288.64,
      "end": 291.8
    },
    {
      "text": "So yeah, traveling means to take more than two steps with the ball.",
      "trans": "英语：所以啊，旅行就是多走几步。",
      "start": 292.8,
      "end": 295.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, let's listen to the dialogue a second time.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 295.8,
      "end": 298.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "This time it'll be a bit slower so that we can understand some of these great phrases",
      "trans": "这个时间会稍微慢一些，这样我们才能更好地理解这些好词句。",
      "start": 298.40000000000003,
      "end": 302.16
    },
    {
      "text": "we just talked about.",
      "trans": "我们刚刚聊了。",
      "start": 302.16,
      "end": 303.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey.",
      "trans": "你好。",
      "start": 303.16,
      "end": 304.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Has the game started yet?",
      "trans": "英语：它还没有开始玩游戏。",
      "start": 304.16,
      "end": 311.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, about five minutes ago.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，大概五分钟前。",
      "start": 311.64,
      "end": 314.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, who's winning?",
      "trans": "对不起，我不太明白您的意思。如果您有其他问题或需要帮助，请随时告诉我！",
      "start": 314.56,
      "end": 316.6
    },
    {
      "text": "The Bulls, of course.",
      "trans": "当然，这里的“Bulls”是“ bulls”的缩写。在中文中，“bulls”通常指的是公牛或雄性动物中的雄性个体。因此，在中国，人们可能会用“Bulls”来指代这些动物。如果你需要翻译成其他语言，请告诉我！",
      "start": 316.6,
      "end": 319.44
    },
    {
      "text": "What?",
      "trans": "英语：What?",
      "start": 319.44,
      "end": 320.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That wasn't a foul.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那不是犯规。”",
      "start": 320.44,
      "end": 321.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, come on, ref.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，来吧，重。",
      "start": 321.6,
      "end": 323.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't worry.",
      "trans": "英语：不要担心。",
      "start": 323.44,
      "end": 324.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.",
      "trans": "沙奎尔·奥尼尔总是失误投篮。",
      "start": 324.76,
      "end": 327.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, you were right.",
      "trans": "是的，你做得对。",
      "start": 327.4,
      "end": 329.12
    },
    {
      "text": "He didn't make this shot.",
      "trans": "他没有把这个照片拍好。",
      "start": 329.12,
      "end": 331.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that was a great shot.",
      "trans": "嗯，那个照片真是好。",
      "start": 331.56,
      "end": 334.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Three pointer.",
      "trans": "三个指针。",
      "start": 334.32,
      "end": 335.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 335.16,
      "end": 335.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, did you see that?",
      "trans": "英语：哦，你看到了什么？",
      "start": 335.92,
      "end": 337.64
    },
    {
      "text": "He traveled and the ref didn't even call it.",
      "trans": "他旅行了，而报告却连名字都没叫出来。",
      "start": 337.64,
      "end": 340.36
