    {
      "text": "This ref needs glasses.",
      "trans": "这个眼镜需要。",
      "start": 340.36,
      "end": 342.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, ref.",
      "trans": "你好，回。",
      "start": 342.6,
      "end": 343.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Open your eyes.",
      "trans": "打开你的眼睛。",
      "start": 343.76,
      "end": 345.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't believe you didn't see that.",
      "trans": "我真不敢相信你没看到那个。",
      "start": 345.88,
      "end": 348.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，好吧。",
      "start": 348.44,
      "end": 349.36
    },
    {
      "text": "At the end of the first quarter, hey, I'm going to make a beer run.",
      "trans": "英语：在第一季度的最后一天，嘿，我要去打篮球了。",
      "start": 349.36,
      "end": 352.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Sweet.",
      "trans": "甜。",
      "start": 352.76,
      "end": 353.76
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, sports fans.",
      "trans": "英语：一切好，球迷们。",
      "start": 357.76,
      "end": 358.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So now let's take a look at fluency builder.",
      "trans": "英语：所以现在让我们看看流利构建单元。",
      "start": 358.92,
      "end": 362.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency builder.",
      "trans": "流畅构建。",
      "start": 362.72,
      "end": 364.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, today on fluency builder, we have two really common words that you would listen to",
      "trans": "好的，今天在流利构建单元中，我们有两句话你可能会听到的很常见的词。",
      "start": 364.2,
      "end": 368.8
    },
    {
      "text": "while you're watching a game.",
      "trans": "在观看游戏时。",
      "start": 368.8,
      "end": 369.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, these are sort of slangy words, hey?",
      "trans": "是的，这些词有些俚语，对吧？",
      "start": 369.84000000000003,
      "end": 372.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, they're kind of a common informal.",
      "trans": "是的，它们有点儿像一个常见的口语表达。",
      "start": 372.04,
      "end": 374.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Informal.",
      "trans": "英语：Informal.",
      "start": 374.68,
      "end": 375.68
    },
    {
      "text": "The first one that we have is screw up.",
      "trans": "第一个是出问题的。",
      "start": 375.68,
      "end": 378.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Screw up.",
      "trans": "英语：弄错。",
      "start": 378.28,
      "end": 379.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Screw up.",
      "trans": "英语：弄错。",
      "start": 379.28,
      "end": 380.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Screw up.",
      "trans": "英语：弄错。",
      "start": 380.28,
      "end": 381.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Two screw up.",
      "trans": "两个螺丝钉。",
      "start": 381.28,
      "end": 382.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so this is a good way of saying to make a mistake.",
      "trans": "是的，所以这个方法好用。",
      "start": 382.28,
      "end": 388.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen to some examples of how this word is used.",
      "trans": "让我们听听一些这个单词是如何使用的例子。",
      "start": 388.2,
      "end": 392.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "例子一。",
      "start": 392.2,
      "end": 393.59999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Jill, you really screwed up this time.",
      "trans": "英语：Jill，你这次真的做错了。",
      "start": 393.59999999999997,
      "end": 398.4
    },
    {
      "text": "You'll fired.",
      "trans": "你将卸下重任。",
      "start": 398.4,
      "end": 404.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "例子二。",
      "start": 404.32,
      "end": 406.32
    },
    {
      "text": "This game is important.",
      "trans": "这个游戏很重要。",
      "start": 407.32,
      "end": 409.64
    },
    {
      "text": "If you screw it up, we're out of the finals.",
      "trans": "如果你们弄错了，我们就出线了。",
      "start": 409.64,
      "end": 413.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Example three.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 413.32,
      "end": 415.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry.",
      "trans": "我非常抱歉。",
      "start": 415.32,
      "end": 418.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I know I screwed up.",
      "trans": "我知错了。",
      "start": 418.32,
      "end": 422.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Forgive me.",
      "trans": "对不起。",
      "start": 422.32,
      "end": 425.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so screw up is mess up.",
      "trans": "好的，所以搞砸了就是搞砸了。",
      "start": 425.32,
      "end": 428.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, make a mistake.",
      "trans": "嗯，犯错。",
      "start": 428.88,
      "end": 429.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a mistake.",
      "trans": "错误。",
      "start": 429.88,
      "end": 430.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh?",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接提供中文翻译。不过，我可以尝试用英文进行翻译：",
      "start": 430.88,
      "end": 431.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "trans": "好。",
      "start": 431.88,
      "end": 432.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And our last word on fluency builder today, a beer run.",
      "trans": "今天，我们讨论了流利构建单元。",
      "start": 432.88,
      "end": 435.2
    },
    {
      "text": "A beer run.",
      "trans": "啤酒跑。",
      "start": 435.2,
      "end": 436.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Beer run.",
      "trans": "啤酒跑。",
      "start": 436.2,
      "end": 437.2
    },
    {
      "text": "So, what is this beer run?",
      "trans": "英语：所以，这瓶啤酒跑得怎么样？",
      "start": 437.2,
      "end": 439.88
    },
    {
      "text": "You run to get beer.",
      "trans": "你跑过去拿酒。",
      "start": 439.88,
      "end": 441.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You go to the store and get beer.",
      "trans": "你去商店买啤酒。",
      "start": 441.92,
      "end": 443.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 443.56,
      "end": 444.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's just an expression to go and get more beer.",
      "trans": "所以，它只是个表达，去喝更多的啤酒。",
      "start": 444.56,
      "end": 447.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, usually you're watching a game or you're at home with your friends.",
      "trans": "是的，通常你是在看电视或和朋友在家里。",
      "start": 447.71999999999997,
      "end": 451.76
    },
    {
      "text": "You run out of beer, so somebody has to make a beer.",
