    },
    {
      "text": "Bulls, of course.",
      "trans": "当然， bulls。",
      "start": 467.8,
      "end": 468.8
    },
    {
      "text": "What?",
      "trans": "什么?",
      "start": 468.8,
      "end": 469.8
    },
    {
      "text": "That wasn't a foul.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那不是犯规。”",
      "start": 469.8,
      "end": 471.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, come on, ref.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，来吧，重。",
      "start": 471.8,
      "end": 473.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, worry.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，担心。",
      "start": 473.8,
      "end": 474.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.",
      "trans": "沙克总是失误投篮。",
      "start": 474.8,
      "end": 476.64
    },
    {
      "text": "You're right.",
      "trans": "你对的。",
