    },
    {
      "text": "I'm in the first quarter.",
      "trans": "我是在第一季度。",
      "start": 498.72,
      "end": 499.96000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, I'm going to make a beer run.",
      "trans": "英语：一切好，我要去打篮球。",
      "start": 499.96000000000004,
      "end": 503.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, guys, I hope you enjoyed our lesson today.",
      "trans": "好的，同学们，我希望大家今天的学习体验愉快。",
      "start": 503.56,
      "end": 508.0
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll be bringing you more sports lessons in the future.",
      "trans": "我们将在未来提供更多的体育课程。",
      "start": 508.0,
      "end": 511.16
