    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 511.16,
      "end": 512.16
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you have a particular sport that you want to learn about, you can tell us.",
      "trans": "所以如果你想学习某个特定的运动，你可以告诉我们。",
      "start": 512.16,
      "end": 515.44
